Zerox a file so the first window is partially covered (Some) and keeps its backing
store, then resize the screen smaller. flresize walks the partially-covered window
on its visible==Some && f.B!=nil branch, freeing the backing store and clearing the
frame -- the path a resize with only fully-visible windows never reaches.

-- input --
move 300 8
button 4
move 300 116
button 0
move 150 100
button 4
move 450 250
button 0
move 300 8
button 4
move 300 29
button 0
move 350 200
button 4
button 0
move 280 180
button 4
move 560 340
button 0
resize 360 280
move 100 10
button 1
button 0
